Subject: [PATCH 10/11] ASoC: rsnd: judge multi SSI in runtime
Date: Thu, 18 Feb 2016 08:18:54 +0000
Message-ID: <87egcatoy7.wl%kuninori.morimoto.gx@renesas.com>
References: <87si0qtp8x.wl%kuninori.morimoto.gx@renesas.com>
